WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 22]

02:16.660 --> 02:17.450
Immortal,

02:17.860 --> 02:18.980
I've heard about

02:18.980 --> 02:20.700
what has happened from Master Shang.

02:20.700 --> 02:22.740
But we can't break the rules in Immortal Palace.

02:22.740 --> 02:24.020
If such an important criminal

02:24.020 --> 02:25.680
wants to leave Litian Temple,

02:25.740 --> 02:28.200
she must be punished by three thunderbolts.

02:28.340 --> 02:29.579
You mean

02:30.780 --> 02:32.780
whether Liu Shao is innocent or not,

02:33.140 --> 02:36.260
she has to be punished with three thunderbolts if she wants to leave, right?

02:36.260 --> 02:37.010
Senior,

02:37.420 --> 02:38.540
I don't think she can stand one thunderbolt now,

02:38.540 --> 02:40.820
let alone three thunderbolts,

02:41.010 --> 02:41.870
Think about it.

02:41.900 --> 02:43.340
If Liu Shao is wronged,

02:43.579 --> 02:45.460
she's already miserable enough now.

02:45.460 --> 02:47.020
Do we have to kill her?

02:47.260 --> 02:48.300
Even if she is wronged,

02:48.300 --> 02:50.020
it's Immortal's responsibility.

02:50.020 --> 02:51.090
Isn't this punishment given to her

02:51.090 --> 02:52.900
because Immortal agreed?

02:54.650 --> 02:57.450
The rules in Immortal Palace cannot be abolished.

02:58.180 --> 02:59.060
Her grievance

03:00.130 --> 03:01.190
is indeed my fault.

03:03.380 --> 03:04.460
I'll be punished

03:07.100 --> 03:07.960
instead of her.

03:10.220 --> 03:10.950
Master Zhuo,

03:11.300 --> 03:12.780
I wonder what will happen

03:13.420 --> 03:15.280
after these three thunderbolts.

03:16.420 --> 03:18.020
Liu Shao will be at your disposal.

03:18.020 --> 03:20.280
The three palaces won't doubt anything.

03:24.900 --> 03:26.220
It is a deal.

03:33.880 --> 03:37.420
♫The wind is getting slower, while the pear flowers are dropping♫

03:35.700 --> 03:37.300
Please seal your spiritual power.

03:37.300 --> 03:39.220
Then, the punishment of thunder can get close to your body.

03:38.440 --> 03:41.520
♫The silver color is cold and sharp♫

03:41.820 --> 03:42.340
Sure.

03:42.940 --> 03:45.090
Within the three whips, there are no class differences.

03:45.090 --> 03:47.100
Everyone in the three palaces can stop me.

03:46.610 --> 03:50.410
♫On the top of Heaven and between reincarnation♫

03:47.460 --> 03:50.460
After three whips when the punishment of thunder has passed,

03:50.460 --> 03:51.940
I will not yield a step.

03:50.950 --> 03:54.550
♫The moon is like snow♫

03:53.340 --> 03:55.000
Whatever Liu Shao's crime is,

03:55.380 --> 03:57.380
I am willing to be punished with her.

03:58.160 --> 04:04.270
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

04:04.270 --> 04:07.330
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

04:07.330 --> 04:10.430
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

04:10.650 --> 04:16.990
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

04:16.990 --> 04:23.630
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

04:23.700 --> 04:24.610
One.

04:49.650 --> 04:53.690
♫The wind is getting slower, while the pear flowers are dropping♫

04:54.150 --> 04:57.710
♫The silver color is cold and sharp♫

05:02.330 --> 05:06.170
♫On the top of Heaven and between reincarnation♫

05:06.710 --> 05:10.230
♫The moon is like snow♫

05:07.690 --> 05:08.460
Two.

05:11.100 --> 05:11.660
Senior.

05:14.910 --> 05:18.960
♫I carve our appointment in three days between my eyebrows♫

05:19.330 --> 05:23.210
♫I walk through time with you♫

05:26.180 --> 05:29.670
♫On the day when seas sink♫

05:30.050 --> 05:38.659
♫When the moon never rests, the mortal world♫

05:39.010 --> 05:45.430
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

05:45.430 --> 05:48.159
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

05:48.159 --> 05:51.640
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

05:48.180 --> 05:49.020
Three.

05:51.640 --> 05:57.890
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

05:57.890 --> 06:05.210
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

06:04.260 --> 06:05.660
I'll take you back now.

06:05.540 --> 06:08.620
♫You left my heart. You are my fate♫

06:08.620 --> 06:11.500
♫You are like dreams as if you disappear♫

06:11.730 --> 06:14.970
♫Two sides are round. You are like the moon at 11 pm♫

06:14.970 --> 06:17.400
♫You are my fate♫

06:17.400 --> 06:22.640
♫Look at the three realms. Look at the wilderness♫

06:22.820 --> 06:25.190
♫Our old fate has become a cocoon♫

06:24.580 --> 06:26.060
I will find out the truth

06:25.190 --> 06:32.710
♫The rest of life is no match for a second♫

06:27.330 --> 06:29.940
about Immortal Master Wanwu being assassinated

06:29.940 --> 06:31.000
and explain to you.

06:32.710 --> 06:39.050
♫I look back to realize the dream of my next life♫

06:39.050 --> 06:41.890
♫Half of my heart is yours. Half of me is missing you♫

06:41.890 --> 06:45.330
♫I pay my life to fulfill my dream♫

06:45.330 --> 06:51.750
♫You nag about days and nights beside my ear, but I can't hear you♫

06:51.750 --> 06:58.060
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

06:58.060 --> 07:08.520
♫The night carves the heart into poems♫

07:25.130 --> 07:27.020
I will not leave.

07:29.740 --> 07:30.300
Luo Ge,

07:31.180 --> 07:32.110
I will not leave.

07:40.050 --> 07:41.250
Don't think too much.

07:44.180 --> 07:45.110
Have a good rest.

07:51.810 --> 07:52.540
Don't go.

07:54.940 --> 07:55.500
Don't go.

08:06.930 --> 08:07.620
Don't go...

08:10.860 --> 08:11.540
Liu Shao,

08:12.460 --> 08:15.190
the person you've been unwilling to lose is Lu Li.

08:15.540 --> 08:17.820
And Lu Li is also me.

08:18.780 --> 08:19.540
From now on,

08:20.500 --> 08:21.450
Luo Ge is Lu Li.

08:22.980 --> 08:24.440
I'll stand in front of you,

08:24.980 --> 08:25.580
trust you,

08:26.340 --> 08:27.270
and protect you.

08:28.370 --> 08:28.780
No.

08:29.980 --> 08:31.110
This must be a dream.

08:32.740 --> 08:34.780
Luo Ge wouldn't say these to me.

08:37.700 --> 08:39.500
Whether it's a dream or not,

08:40.820 --> 08:42.860
I will never let you go again.

08:45.820 --> 08:47.060
Cultivating for

08:47.700 --> 08:49.430
thousands of years lonesomely

08:50.580 --> 08:51.980
is not good at all.

08:56.420 --> 09:00.150
But someone has to experience the loneliness of thousands of years

09:00.700 --> 09:02.760
to protect peace in the Three Realms.

09:12.060 --> 09:13.120
Liu Shao, Liu Shao.

09:16.020 --> 09:16.980
Immortal, Immortal,

09:16.980 --> 09:17.940
how's Liu Shao?

09:18.180 --> 09:20.380
I heard that Liu Shao's energy pill was badly damaged.

09:20.380 --> 09:21.240
Is she okay now?

09:22.580 --> 09:23.440
She's fine now.

09:23.780 --> 09:25.100
She hasn't woken up yet.

09:25.100 --> 09:26.140
Don't disturb her.

09:26.140 --> 09:26.860
Immortal,

09:27.060 --> 09:28.180
I am King Herb aged 10 thousand years.

09:28.180 --> 09:29.060
If a mortal smells me,

09:29.060 --> 09:30.380
all diseases will be cured.

09:30.380 --> 09:31.460
If I stay beside Liu Shao,

09:31.460 --> 09:32.540
with the herbal fragrance accompanying her,

09:32.540 --> 09:33.870
she can recover faster.

09:34.700 --> 09:35.620
Go ahead now.

09:35.820 --> 09:36.940
She has already gone down the mountain.

09:36.940 --> 09:38.200
How could this happen?

09:38.340 --> 09:39.900
I thought I could give you Weirui Grass, and

09:39.900 --> 09:40.940
I could go to Liu Mansion

09:40.940 --> 09:42.670
to see the pear tree at her home.

09:43.500 --> 09:43.940
Wait.

09:45.540 --> 09:46.770
I wonder if you have medicine

09:46.770 --> 09:48.180
for internal injury.

10:07.500 --> 10:08.830
The harp lacks a string.

10:09.780 --> 10:10.780
Legend has it that

10:11.460 --> 10:12.740
fairies' hair

10:13.940 --> 10:14.800
can be strings.

10:29.100 --> 10:29.700
Fu.

10:35.660 --> 10:36.590
It doesn't work.

10:44.060 --> 10:44.570
Fu,

10:45.460 --> 10:46.420
I will save you.

12:10.540 --> 12:11.020
Rong,

12:13.020 --> 12:15.880
you also think that the measures I took are drastic.

12:16.020 --> 12:19.100
Although there is a strong possibility that Liu Shao is framed,

12:19.100 --> 12:21.300
I insisted on executing the punishment of thunder.

12:21.300 --> 12:23.360
You think I am too cruel and inhumane,

12:23.970 --> 12:24.580
right?

12:26.060 --> 12:27.460
Actually, I understand.

12:27.980 --> 12:30.110
Senior, as the master of Palace Wuxie,

12:30.180 --> 12:31.910
you take charge of the penalty.

12:32.140 --> 12:34.380
You only care about rules and regulations.

12:34.380 --> 12:35.580
It is the same for yourself

12:35.580 --> 12:36.440
and for others.

12:37.340 --> 12:38.820
You were not targeting Luo Ge.

12:38.820 --> 12:40.660
No, I was targeting Luo Ge.

12:40.660 --> 12:42.260
I even targeted many people.

12:42.850 --> 12:43.650
I understand.

12:44.560 --> 12:45.780
After my father died,

12:46.010 --> 12:47.930
Palace Chonghua became more and more powerful,

12:47.930 --> 12:51.500
while Palace of Abyssal Mirrors is not as powerful as Palace Chonghua.

12:51.500 --> 12:52.500
You

12:52.860 --> 12:54.560
were entrusted by my father.

12:55.260 --> 12:58.190
But I am not good enough, and I am laughed at by others,

12:58.740 --> 13:00.620
so you're always against others.

13:04.660 --> 13:05.620
You did it for me.

13:11.700 --> 13:12.900
You know everything,

13:14.740 --> 13:16.670
but you always pretend not to know.

13:18.420 --> 13:18.940
Rong,

13:21.460 --> 13:22.320
I've had enough

13:27.460 --> 13:28.420
as your senior.

13:49.940 --> 13:52.300
I want to be more than just your junior,

13:54.020 --> 13:54.740
Senior.

14:30.460 --> 14:31.580
Is it two hours?

14:32.060 --> 14:33.390
I'll get you some water.

14:35.700 --> 14:36.340
No need.

14:40.060 --> 14:40.790
Move slowly.

14:50.100 --> 14:50.860
It seems that

14:51.100 --> 14:52.130
you are fine.

14:53.180 --> 14:54.140
Bone-Corroding Harp is

14:54.140 --> 14:55.600
really a healing halidom.

14:56.980 --> 14:57.910
Rumors are true.

15:01.060 --> 15:02.020
Could it be that

15:03.180 --> 15:04.460
I am really...

15:05.340 --> 15:07.270
Does the immortal energy in my body

15:07.540 --> 15:09.060
really belong to

15:10.060 --> 15:12.660
the Immortal Ze Shui who died in the demon clan?

15:13.580 --> 15:14.380
No wonder...

15:16.460 --> 15:17.790
no wonder my brother...

15:18.340 --> 15:19.180
He is him.

15:19.180 --> 15:20.020
You are you.

15:20.220 --> 15:21.620
Fate never starts again.

15:22.860 --> 15:24.190
I never believe in fate.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.740
Don't believe it either.

15:31.940 --> 15:33.740
Let me see the wound on your hand.

15:35.660 --> 15:38.060
I don't know what's wrong with Bone-Corroding Harp.

15:38.060 --> 15:39.740
It can't even cure my wound.

15:40.740 --> 15:41.470
It is because

15:42.220 --> 15:43.550
you only cared about me.

15:52.300 --> 15:53.430
It's a little itchy.

15:55.260 --> 15:56.520
Actually, I want to ask

15:56.700 --> 15:57.960
what you are going to do

15:58.660 --> 16:00.190
with Bone-Corroding Harp.

16:01.780 --> 16:04.240
I'll put it back to Palace of Abyssal Mirrors

16:04.260 --> 16:06.460
and pretend nothing has happened.

16:07.100 --> 16:09.100
My brother doesn't want me to know it

16:09.140 --> 16:10.820
because he wants to protect me.

16:10.820 --> 16:11.620
I understand.

16:12.260 --> 16:13.460
I'll protect him too,

16:14.420 --> 16:15.060
secretly.

16:16.940 --> 16:17.740
I understand.

16:18.290 --> 16:20.890
It is just like how I want to protect my brother.

16:23.020 --> 16:23.580
And

16:26.220 --> 16:27.350
I want to protect you

16:28.620 --> 16:30.940
and let you be a happy little fairy.

16:38.300 --> 16:39.220
Fu, look,

16:40.620 --> 16:42.150
the restriction is lifted.

16:43.340 --> 16:44.660
Does this mean

16:44.900 --> 16:46.700
my brother and Liu Shao are safe?

16:53.140 --> 16:55.470
He really thinks that I am so old and stupid

16:56.060 --> 16:58.120
that I can't recognize the murderer.

16:58.460 --> 17:00.260
Immortal Luo Ge has sent a message.

17:00.260 --> 17:02.540
He said that he would find out the truth.

17:02.540 --> 17:03.580
What truth?

17:05.300 --> 17:07.740
The truth is that he is bewitched by Liu Shao

17:08.180 --> 17:09.780
and keeps protecting her.

17:10.740 --> 17:13.060
I don't need his medicine.

17:13.220 --> 17:14.740
Return it to him.

17:18.619 --> 17:21.619
Immortal Master has such prejudice against Liu Shao.

17:22.540 --> 17:23.460
Yes.

17:24.579 --> 17:26.380
If I hadn't remembered the past,

17:26.940 --> 17:28.339
I'd probably be the same.

17:45.180 --> 17:45.780
This is...

17:47.300 --> 17:48.020
spell.

17:53.690 --> 17:54.300
Brother!

17:55.100 --> 17:55.660
Brother!

18:00.860 --> 18:02.460
Brother, what's the matter?

18:03.420 --> 18:04.140
I'm fine.

18:05.220 --> 18:05.940
I have...

18:07.220 --> 18:08.620
been busy lately.

18:09.780 --> 18:10.840
I need to calm down.

18:11.770 --> 18:13.060
I'm glad you're fine.

18:13.420 --> 18:14.900
I've heard about

18:15.420 --> 18:17.220
what happened in Litian Temple.

18:17.660 --> 18:19.500
Although we haven't found the murderer,

18:19.500 --> 18:22.430
fortunately, Immortal Master and Liu Shao are fine.

18:22.940 --> 18:25.660
Brother, don't worry too much.

18:25.660 --> 18:26.590
I'm not worried.

18:27.780 --> 18:29.210
After these,

18:30.140 --> 18:31.800
I will check your schoolwork.

18:32.460 --> 18:33.410
Don't slack off.

18:34.300 --> 18:35.060
Brother,

18:35.060 --> 18:35.860
do you mean

18:35.860 --> 18:37.540
those scriptures that you let me recite?

18:37.540 --> 18:38.980
I've already memorized them.

18:38.980 --> 18:40.420
You can check at any time.

18:42.580 --> 18:43.540
Okay.

18:43.540 --> 18:44.460
I won't disturb you.

18:44.460 --> 18:45.740
I'll go back first.

18:45.740 --> 18:46.450
Tomorrow,

18:46.450 --> 18:48.020
I'll bring you

18:48.020 --> 18:49.810
some fragrance to help you calm down,

18:49.810 --> 18:50.650
OK?

18:50.650 --> 18:51.260
Okay.

18:51.820 --> 18:52.820
I'm leaving.

19:13.180 --> 19:14.540
I'm devoted to cultivating.

19:14.540 --> 19:15.940
I won't have Lu Li's feelings.

19:15.940 --> 19:16.900
You have his feelings.

19:16.900 --> 19:18.620
I heard that Lu Li was cursed by Soul-Devouring Spell.

19:18.620 --> 19:20.300
He couldn't break it even when he died.

19:20.300 --> 19:21.300
Look, do I have it?

19:26.860 --> 19:27.790
It turns out that

19:28.780 --> 19:29.710
I really have it.

19:30.940 --> 19:32.400
It comes out from the heart

19:33.140 --> 19:34.620
and arrives with love.

19:50.580 --> 19:51.700
Luo Ge!

19:55.100 --> 19:55.620
Liu Shao,

19:55.620 --> 19:56.880
you're finally awake.

19:58.780 --> 20:00.260
Try it and see what soup this is.

20:00.260 --> 20:02.390
You haven't eaten food for a long time.

20:05.250 --> 20:06.580
It is water shield soup.

20:07.780 --> 20:09.540
There are some bamboo shoots

20:10.620 --> 20:11.700
and saury.

20:12.980 --> 20:14.020
In the mortal world,

20:14.020 --> 20:15.300
these food are in season.

20:15.300 --> 20:16.700
I thought you would like it,

20:16.700 --> 20:18.050
so I let you try it.

20:20.300 --> 20:21.700
It's been a while since

20:22.580 --> 20:25.380
I left the mortal world.

20:29.380 --> 20:30.910
The seasonal dishes at home

20:31.460 --> 20:33.190
are made by my mother in person.

20:33.740 --> 20:35.140
My father often said that

20:35.380 --> 20:37.240
with my mother's cooking skills,

20:37.460 --> 20:39.620
even if she broke his legs,

20:39.620 --> 20:40.950
he wouldn't leave home.

20:45.020 --> 20:46.060
I once thought of

20:47.580 --> 20:49.220
bringing a person home and

20:50.260 --> 20:51.980
trying my mother's cooking.

20:53.420 --> 20:54.950
Do you still wish to do that?

21:01.340 --> 21:02.660
Immortal

21:02.660 --> 21:03.860
has a conscience.

21:04.460 --> 21:06.380
He went to Litian Temple for you

21:06.380 --> 21:07.500
and got you back.

21:09.700 --> 21:10.580
Do you mean that

21:11.620 --> 21:13.300
Luo Ge sent me back?

21:13.300 --> 21:13.820
Yes.

21:13.820 --> 21:15.940
He even accepted three thunderbolts for you.

21:15.940 --> 21:18.380
Otherwise, Master Zhuo wouldn't let you go.

21:18.380 --> 21:19.700
That silly man

21:19.700 --> 21:20.980
is a bit dull,

21:20.980 --> 21:22.570
but he's still on your side.

21:22.570 --> 21:23.980
He thought he was smart.

21:23.980 --> 21:25.900
But Master knew it right away that

21:25.900 --> 21:27.540
he fed you Weirui Grass.

21:29.140 --> 21:29.930
Master,

21:30.180 --> 21:31.460
are you telling the truth?

21:31.460 --> 21:33.020
Absolutely.

21:33.020 --> 21:34.100
Except for Weirui Grass,

21:34.100 --> 21:35.540
I've written them down on it.

21:35.540 --> 21:37.220
Immortal was awesome that day.

21:37.220 --> 21:40.350
He held you and stepped out of the punishment of thunder.

21:46.130 --> 21:47.020
Luo Ge!

21:47.620 --> 21:48.780
Luo Ge!

21:51.540 --> 21:52.140
Luo Ge!

21:54.980 --> 21:55.900
Luo Ge!

22:01.940 --> 22:02.930
Luo Ge.

22:06.860 --> 22:08.980
I just want to check on you.

22:23.700 --> 22:24.780
I know that

22:26.690 --> 22:28.690
our power is against each other, and

22:29.740 --> 22:31.340
I shouldn't have come to you.

22:31.980 --> 22:33.410
But I'm worried.

22:33.410 --> 22:35.140
I just want to see you.

22:37.220 --> 22:38.380
And Weirui Grass...

22:39.540 --> 22:41.260
I planted it for you.

22:43.580 --> 22:45.580
Wan Sui said you let me have it.

22:47.660 --> 22:49.520
You suffered three thunderbolts

22:49.540 --> 22:51.100
for me.

22:52.460 --> 22:53.900
You need it more than I do.

22:57.060 --> 22:57.940
Luo Ge,

23:00.020 --> 23:01.860
I just want to see you.

23:06.500 --> 23:08.060
Luo Ge, are you okay?

23:08.420 --> 23:09.880
The truth is not clear yet.

23:10.140 --> 23:11.070
You can't leave.

23:16.540 --> 23:18.100
But if I don't leave,

23:19.460 --> 23:20.740
you'll get hurt.

23:21.420 --> 23:22.550
Do you think I'm you,

23:23.460 --> 23:25.500
who gets hurt when you don't pay attention?

23:25.500 --> 23:26.780
I didn't want to.

23:28.450 --> 23:31.140
I didn't expect that fate would mess with us like this.

23:31.140 --> 23:33.070
Lu Li is like this. You are the same.

23:35.220 --> 23:35.900
Are you...

23:37.020 --> 23:38.100
Are you okay?

23:38.540 --> 23:40.340
The conflict of power between us

23:40.500 --> 23:43.020
is not as serious as what Immortal Master has said.

23:43.020 --> 23:44.820
I will investigate this matter.

23:45.140 --> 23:46.540
You don't need to worry about it.

23:46.540 --> 23:47.170
Okay.

23:47.980 --> 23:48.900
I will stay

23:49.860 --> 23:50.780
to investigate

23:51.500 --> 23:53.300
who hurt Immortal Master.

23:53.780 --> 23:55.380
I will prove to everyone that

23:55.500 --> 23:56.380
I'm innocent.

23:57.050 --> 23:57.980
I will prove that

23:58.140 --> 24:01.000
you didn't trust the wrong person for your own good.

24:02.500 --> 24:03.560
What's the matter?

24:05.450 --> 24:06.090
Nothing.

24:07.220 --> 24:08.280
I was just thinking

24:08.660 --> 24:10.390
how you will find the murderer.

24:17.860 --> 24:19.520
This person wants to set me up.

24:19.820 --> 24:21.210
In other words,

24:22.050 --> 24:23.260
he failed to frame me

24:23.820 --> 24:25.180
this time,

24:25.620 --> 24:26.550
he will probably

24:26.780 --> 24:27.900
kill me himself.

24:28.140 --> 24:29.100
So,

24:29.100 --> 24:31.220
let me be the bait.

24:31.220 --> 24:34.220
Let's catch him in a trap.

24:34.740 --> 24:35.380
What do you think?

24:35.380 --> 24:36.420
It is a bad idea.

24:36.940 --> 24:38.420
We've alerted the enemy.

24:38.860 --> 24:39.990
How can you lure him?

24:44.540 --> 24:45.460
You're right.

24:46.860 --> 24:48.980
Maybe he has a personal grudge against Immortal Master.

24:48.980 --> 24:51.020
How about investigating from here?

24:51.020 --> 24:52.950
You don't need to worry about this.

24:53.740 --> 24:55.000
I will investigate it.

24:55.420 --> 24:57.060
Don't act rashly for the time being.

24:57.060 --> 24:58.720
And this person must hate you.

25:09.540 --> 25:10.660
What is this?

25:11.580 --> 25:12.580
This is Wang Bell.

25:13.260 --> 25:14.860
Remember to take it with you.

25:15.540 --> 25:16.670
If you are in danger,

25:17.900 --> 25:19.760
Moon Bell will be able to sense it.

25:20.460 --> 25:22.590
And they will monitor your every move.

25:24.900 --> 25:26.260
Does it mean that

25:26.940 --> 25:28.870
Moon Bell will know whatever I say?

25:31.780 --> 25:32.420
So,

25:33.060 --> 25:34.990
don't talk about me behind my back.

25:36.300 --> 25:38.100
I will speak and act cautiously.

25:38.260 --> 25:39.260
I will speak less.

25:48.180 --> 25:48.980
These days,

25:49.420 --> 25:51.460
you just need to merge your air with it

25:51.460 --> 25:52.590
and stay close to it.

25:53.690 --> 25:54.930
Stay close to it?

25:56.460 --> 25:57.820
At here?

26:03.260 --> 26:03.740
Okay.

26:04.220 --> 26:06.340
Your brother and future sister-in-law are fine.

26:06.340 --> 26:07.540
Are you relieved now?

26:08.420 --> 26:09.420
My brother must have been seriously injured

26:09.420 --> 26:10.690
this time.

26:11.860 --> 26:13.020
You imagine things

26:13.020 --> 26:14.380
just because he didn't let you in.

26:14.380 --> 26:15.020
At that time,

26:15.020 --> 26:16.570
why didn't you play a little trick

26:16.570 --> 26:17.370
and go inside?

26:17.900 --> 26:19.300
I wanted to go inside.

26:20.620 --> 26:21.700
But when I thought that

26:21.700 --> 26:23.300
my brother lied to me

26:23.300 --> 26:25.760
because he didn't want me to worry about him,

26:25.820 --> 26:27.550
I could put up with everything.

26:28.100 --> 26:29.500
Our little fairy

26:29.500 --> 26:30.580
has grown up.

26:32.380 --> 26:33.100
By the way,

26:33.410 --> 26:35.220
remember to remind Liu Shao.

26:35.500 --> 26:37.560
She must take good care of my brother.

26:37.580 --> 26:39.980
If my brother is unhappy,

26:39.980 --> 26:41.040
or he loses weight,

26:41.260 --> 26:43.020
I will take my brother back.

26:43.220 --> 26:44.300
Take him away.

26:47.980 --> 26:50.940
Are you eating bitter gourds in the mortal world?

26:51.740 --> 26:53.340
Are you silly because you have stayed in Immortal Palace for too long?

26:53.340 --> 26:55.740
You can't even tell the difference between melons and bitter gourds.

26:55.740 --> 26:58.300
But these look bitter.

26:59.700 --> 27:01.620
I've planted all kinds of plants.

27:01.620 --> 27:02.810
This is obviously a melon.

27:02.810 --> 27:04.470
Try it if you don't believe me.

27:05.860 --> 27:07.500
Thank you, Master.

27:11.740 --> 27:12.540
The sisters

27:12.540 --> 27:13.780
are both tricky.

27:19.060 --> 27:19.540
Girl,

27:19.850 --> 27:21.300
your things have all been packed.

27:21.300 --> 27:22.060
In the next few days,

27:22.060 --> 27:23.520
follow Immortal's words.

27:34.380 --> 27:35.610
Where do I live?

27:40.980 --> 27:42.040
Sleep on the floor.

27:42.100 --> 27:43.170
Sleep on the floor?

27:45.340 --> 27:48.070
Here is so big but you want me to sleep on the floor.

27:57.100 --> 27:58.140
What is this?

28:00.020 --> 28:00.950
Mandarin ducks?

28:01.420 --> 28:03.770
Wan Sui is rubbernecking.

28:05.540 --> 28:06.740
What mandarin ducks?

28:10.460 --> 28:10.940
Well...

28:11.460 --> 28:12.170
they are

28:13.420 --> 28:14.220
ducks.

28:26.940 --> 28:28.000
What are you doing?

28:28.620 --> 28:29.540
At night,

28:29.540 --> 28:31.180
the dew is heavy and there are many mosquitoes.

28:31.180 --> 28:31.780
This

28:31.780 --> 28:34.180
can calm your nerves and repel mosquitoes.

28:34.450 --> 28:35.220
But

28:35.290 --> 28:36.420
the wind is too strong.

28:36.420 --> 28:38.350
I'm afraid it'll blow out the lamp.

28:39.290 --> 28:40.690
This is Immortal Palace.

28:41.580 --> 28:43.260
There's no trouble which is in the mortal world.

28:43.260 --> 28:44.100
Even if

28:44.100 --> 28:45.620
there is no mosquitoes,

28:45.620 --> 28:46.780
it can light up a corner.

28:46.780 --> 28:47.580
Then

28:47.580 --> 28:49.420
it won't be so dark at night.

28:50.410 --> 28:52.140
Night and day are natural.

28:53.060 --> 28:54.860
Why should it be bright at night?

28:56.060 --> 28:57.540
If you follow the laws of day and night,

28:57.540 --> 28:59.500
why do you read and write at night?

28:59.500 --> 29:00.620
Then why do we have the moon?

29:00.620 --> 29:03.220
Isn't the moon natural?

29:14.620 --> 29:15.660
Let me tell you.

29:19.460 --> 29:20.980
When I was young,

29:21.380 --> 29:23.580
my father used to do business.

29:23.580 --> 29:24.860
Every day when he returned home,

29:24.860 --> 29:26.180
it was after midnight.

29:26.460 --> 29:27.380
My mother

29:27.380 --> 29:28.500
put a light

29:28.500 --> 29:29.420
at the door

29:31.100 --> 29:32.740
to tell my father

29:32.740 --> 29:34.580
no matter how late he came back,

29:34.580 --> 29:36.840
someone would be waiting for him at home.

29:39.700 --> 29:41.630
What do you mean by lighting a lamp?

29:43.780 --> 29:45.260
With I lighting such a lamp,

29:45.260 --> 29:47.420
you won't feel lonely.

29:48.460 --> 29:49.180
Well...

29:49.420 --> 29:50.480
As the saying goes,

29:50.620 --> 29:52.700
the moon is bright or dim and she may wax or wane

29:52.700 --> 29:53.780
But I hope

29:53.890 --> 29:56.090
people can be reunited most of the time.

29:56.140 --> 29:57.620
In this way,

29:58.290 --> 29:59.820
you can be a deity earlier.

30:39.220 --> 30:41.480
Liu Shao has returned to Xiyin Mountain.

30:41.780 --> 30:44.040
It looks like you can do nothing with her.

30:45.300 --> 30:46.740
We don't know

30:47.050 --> 30:48.220
who will win now.

30:51.140 --> 30:52.200
You have some guts.

30:52.620 --> 30:53.700
I admire you.

30:56.290 --> 30:57.940
You left Waterside Pavilion.

30:57.940 --> 30:59.620
It looks like Fairy Luo Ning

30:59.620 --> 31:00.950
still can't defeat you.

31:06.170 --> 31:06.980
What is this?

31:08.420 --> 31:10.020
It is for my master, Lu Sheng.

31:10.700 --> 31:12.500
Today is his death anniversary.

31:13.460 --> 31:14.460
No matter what,

31:15.260 --> 31:17.180
he brought me and Lu Li up.

31:18.370 --> 31:19.970
If it weren't because of him,

31:21.090 --> 31:23.420
Lu Li wouldn't be the closest person to me.

31:24.860 --> 31:25.790
Unfortunately,

31:27.300 --> 31:29.900
Lu Li doesn't think you're his closest person.

31:30.820 --> 31:32.380
And now, Lu Li

31:32.380 --> 31:33.540
has become Luo Ge.

31:34.580 --> 31:36.100
You're not in his heart.

31:37.740 --> 31:38.700
It's okay.

31:39.060 --> 31:41.050
I won't let him leave me,

31:41.980 --> 31:44.660
even if I have to make him a walking dead.

32:06.220 --> 32:07.580
As an immortal,

32:08.300 --> 32:10.700
I am trapped by the spell in the mortal world

32:10.900 --> 32:11.940
and can't be free.

32:28.020 --> 32:30.150
Since you're familiar with her scent,

32:30.980 --> 32:32.240
follow her from now on.

32:32.860 --> 32:33.900
If one day

32:34.300 --> 32:36.430
she and I are in danger at the same time,

32:36.660 --> 32:38.260
You can only stay by her side.

32:39.620 --> 32:40.780
Protecting her

32:41.740 --> 32:43.020
is protecting me.

32:56.620 --> 32:57.300
Luo Ge.

33:52.810 --> 33:54.700
With Wang Bell on the side,

33:56.900 --> 33:58.180
it feels like

33:58.180 --> 34:00.340
you are always beside me.

34:00.740 --> 34:02.540
I feel so relieved.

34:11.060 --> 34:13.060
When you are in danger in the future,

34:13.100 --> 34:15.500
you can use your power to activate Wang Bell.

34:15.500 --> 34:17.360
Then, Moon Bell on me can sense it.

34:22.050 --> 34:22.699
By the way,

34:22.780 --> 34:24.639
you said that that person hates me

34:25.060 --> 34:27.260
and she has the aura of my Sun Spirit.

34:28.739 --> 34:29.670
Now it seems that

34:30.300 --> 34:32.460
she got Sun Fragments from you.

34:32.780 --> 34:34.239
Since she could know these

34:34.540 --> 34:35.800
and got the fragments,

34:35.980 --> 34:37.340
she must know you well.

34:38.580 --> 34:40.040
Do you have anyone in mind?

34:48.020 --> 34:48.550
Bai Feng.

34:52.219 --> 34:52.929
But...

34:53.460 --> 34:55.780
how could she be so capable?

34:57.100 --> 34:58.340
She can't do it alone.

34:59.500 --> 35:01.160
So we need to get the evidence.

35:03.380 --> 35:05.780
The key is to lure out the person behind her.

35:06.100 --> 35:06.980
This person

35:07.900 --> 35:09.660
is also the one who Xie Lingqi refused to tell us

35:09.660 --> 35:12.120
even if he was thrown into Bone Melting Pool.

35:16.500 --> 35:18.630
I keep my promise and never turn you in.

35:18.700 --> 35:19.340
But you...

35:19.460 --> 35:21.020
but you watch me

35:21.660 --> 35:23.900
suffer here. I can't die or survive.

35:25.220 --> 35:26.220
Why?

35:27.460 --> 35:28.540
Why?

35:32.780 --> 35:33.780
Xie Lingqi,

35:37.300 --> 35:39.660
you know how difficult it is

35:39.900 --> 35:41.360
to deal with the immortal.

35:41.820 --> 35:43.420
You need to give me some time.

35:48.060 --> 35:49.390
You can actually hear me

35:49.700 --> 35:50.780
and answer me.

35:51.180 --> 35:52.710
Are you in Immortal Palace?

35:53.420 --> 35:55.220
Not only am I in Immortal Palace,

35:55.900 --> 35:58.420
but also in a place you can't imagine.

36:07.020 --> 36:08.500
You are so capable.

36:10.500 --> 36:11.700
Let me out!

36:13.740 --> 36:15.060
I have a treasure.

36:17.540 --> 36:19.060
I have Ao Hen's son.

36:21.740 --> 36:22.940
For a thousand years,

36:23.060 --> 36:25.020
Ao Hen fed him countless demon energy.

36:25.020 --> 36:26.750
His demon power is quite great.

36:33.460 --> 36:34.740
Ao Hen is so generous.

36:35.460 --> 36:37.320
Fortunately, we found him first.

36:37.700 --> 36:39.300
If her son wakes up,

36:40.540 --> 36:43.400
I'm afraid he'll be a disaster for Immortal Palace.

36:43.620 --> 36:44.340
Seal him.

36:44.700 --> 36:45.180
Yes.

36:46.340 --> 36:47.700
As long as you cultivate it,

36:47.700 --> 36:50.100
you'll have another master to work for you.

36:52.700 --> 36:53.570
Ao Yin?

36:54.740 --> 36:55.540
That's right.

36:56.980 --> 36:59.040
Matters need to be managed one by one.

36:59.940 --> 37:01.860
After I finish what I am doing,

37:02.340 --> 37:03.820
I will come to save you.

37:04.180 --> 37:04.940
Don't go.

37:05.980 --> 37:07.340
Let me out!

37:07.900 --> 37:09.540
Someone is waiting for me.

37:25.700 --> 37:27.170
A person is waiting for me.

37:29.100 --> 37:30.900
She is waiting for me to save her.

37:33.060 --> 37:34.590
It's been a thousand years.

37:50.100 --> 37:50.900
Immortal,

37:51.180 --> 37:53.510
I picked flowers according to your order.

37:54.020 --> 37:55.540
Put it by Xuan Ling Wood.

37:58.380 --> 38:00.740
I even picked the most powerful one.

38:01.380 --> 38:02.710
Liu Shao has touched it.

38:03.130 --> 38:05.300
I'm afraid there's still her scent on it,

38:05.300 --> 38:07.230
so I asked you to bring some flowers

38:07.540 --> 38:08.900
to remove her scent.

38:11.860 --> 38:13.790
There should not be any other scent

38:13.820 --> 38:14.980
in my place.

38:16.020 --> 38:16.660
Yes.

38:22.100 --> 38:23.300
Xuan Ling Wood is strong.

38:23.300 --> 38:25.660
The flowers need to be wrapped with magic power.

38:25.660 --> 38:27.720
Otherwise, it will burn the flowers.

38:31.020 --> 38:31.500
Yes.

39:03.700 --> 39:04.700
I'm incompetent.

39:04.860 --> 39:05.920
I'll change it now.

39:06.460 --> 39:06.920
No need.

39:08.300 --> 39:10.260
Your cultivation is nothing more than this.

39:10.260 --> 39:11.060
You may leave.

39:12.340 --> 39:12.890
Yes.

39:23.540 --> 39:26.460
You said Luo Ge asked you to get close to Xuan Ling Wood

39:26.460 --> 39:27.920
and let you use your power.

39:29.690 --> 39:31.460
He seldom talks so much to me,

39:32.180 --> 39:34.020
so I was sure he was weird

39:34.330 --> 39:36.180
and didn't use my power on purpose.

39:36.180 --> 39:37.440
That's why I was burnt.

39:37.890 --> 39:39.220
He's suspicious of you.

39:39.660 --> 39:40.500
No way.

39:40.620 --> 39:41.500
I did a good job.

39:44.500 --> 39:47.060
You must have heard about Xuan Ling Wood absorbing demon energy

39:47.060 --> 39:48.700
from Lu Sheng, right?

39:51.260 --> 39:53.390
My master mentioned Immortal Palace,

39:53.740 --> 39:55.340
so I was especially careful.

39:57.820 --> 39:59.100
The power in your body

39:59.500 --> 40:01.500
is mixed with Ao Hen's demon energy.

40:01.820 --> 40:03.540
You burnt yourself deliberately

40:03.540 --> 40:04.220
to prevent

40:04.220 --> 40:06.890
Xuan Ling Wood from absorbing your spiritual power,

40:06.890 --> 40:08.170
and Luo Ge from finding out that

40:08.170 --> 40:09.820
you're related to the demonic realm,

40:09.820 --> 40:10.380
right?

40:11.780 --> 40:13.240
Then I wasn't wrong at all.

40:14.220 --> 40:15.460
You were wrong,

40:15.660 --> 40:17.140
totally wrong.

40:17.860 --> 40:18.660
Let me ask you.

40:19.060 --> 40:21.120
What does Xuan Ling Wood need to grow?

40:25.100 --> 40:27.430
Immortals water it with spiritual power.

40:27.980 --> 40:29.240
It doesn't need water.

40:30.300 --> 40:31.030
Ridiculous.

40:32.330 --> 40:34.300
No matter how the world change,

40:34.420 --> 40:36.350
water is the origin of everything.

40:39.140 --> 40:40.580
Even if he is Luo Ge,

40:41.220 --> 40:43.420
he still needs to use his power to create rain

40:43.420 --> 40:44.880
to nourish Xuan Ling Wood.

40:54.140 --> 40:56.140
When you got close to Xuan Ling Wood,

40:56.660 --> 40:58.020
there should be a lot of dew

40:58.020 --> 40:59.500
on the leaves.

41:04.690 --> 41:05.460
These

41:05.660 --> 41:07.720
are made of Luo Ge's spiritual power.

41:08.580 --> 41:10.100
As long as it's on you,

41:10.500 --> 41:12.300
it can still take away your power

41:12.780 --> 41:14.180
without you noticing it.

41:15.140 --> 41:16.020
So,

41:17.260 --> 41:18.700
he was testing me.

41:21.540 --> 41:22.600
It was not testing.

41:23.460 --> 41:25.860
He took such evidence from you

41:28.380 --> 41:31.060
because he was certain that you were the suspect.
